<title>USA: No sign of Iraq troop build-up in south - official.</title>
<headline>No sign of Iraq troop build-up in south - official.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A U.S. Defense official denied a report that Iraq was massing troops near its southern border.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no indication of any such build-up,&quot; said the official, who asked not to be identifed, when asked about a report from Dubai quoting claims by Shiite muslim groups that Iraq was building forces in the south, including around Basrah, Amarah and one other province.</p>
</text>
